  assumed "the November export's day is not stated: the 2nd of the next month (story)"
  note "The November export stops on 2025-11-13 though its header names the whole month (records/cis-2025.tally); December's opens on 2025-12-01. What happened on Cis in between is not in the records."
  gap_cards = ?"What did Piotr pay by card from 2025-11-14 to 2025-11-30? The November export stops on the 13th" "cis-5521-3380-0001-2025-11.csv: the last row is of 2025-11-13"
  gap_from = 2025-11-14 "cis-5521-3380-0001-2025-11.csv: the last row is of 2025-11-13"
  gap_to = 2025-11-30 "cis-5521-3380-0001-2025-12.csv line 5: the December export opens on 2025-12-01"
  gap_ziarno = ?"Did Kawiarnia Ziarno pay FV 016/2025 from 2025-11-14 to 2025-11-30? Those Cis rows are missing" "cis-5521-3380-0001-2025-11.csv: the last row is of 2025-11-13"

