version ziarno_open
  cite faktura
  governs always
  known 2025-08-14
  ziarno_inv = fv_016_2025 "faktura-sales-2022-2025.csv line 60: Kawiarnia Ziarno's August invoice FV 016/2025, issued 2025-08-14, the one the story says nothing was heard about. An input, not the literal key, since the gap's movement is read at cuts before the invoice exists (RUN-KEY), and known on its issue day so that the movement, read as known on its own days, sees it"
